            {
                "entry_id": "e0cb8fd1-cda7-3833-a760-dc3350faace8",
                "word": "ziggourat",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "7e9d5f16-7528-4f84-8c99-23f7e384ea08",
                        "entry_id": "e0cb8fd1-cda7-3833-a760-dc3350faace8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ziggourats"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "cf0f0c90-bf79-49e8-b088-50e5e9d0484d",
                        "entry_id": "e0cb8fd1-cda7-3833-a760-dc3350faace8",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "ziggurat"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bdf4564f-2c2e-397b-ac77-b7dcc9a5872a",
                        "entry_id": "e0cb8fd1-cda7-3833-a760-dc3350faace8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Édifice religieux mésopotamien en forme de pyramide à étages, dont la fonction demeure floue même s’il s’agirait plutôt d’un lieu de cultes et de sacrifices, qui comportait un sanctuaire. C’est à partir de trois plates-formes que ce genre d’édifices est appelé ziggourat, le maximum étant de sept niveaux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9630041b-f8e6-4314-bbfc-24816a9183f2",
                                "sense_id": "bdf4564f-2c2e-397b-ac77-b7dcc9a5872a",
                                "text": "Des monticules en forme de ziggourats poussaient par terre tandis que des piles précaires et autres tours penchées s’élevaient au sommet de la cloison."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91f01c79-4a02-436e-96b3-dab2c95f47ce",
                                "sense_id": "bdf4564f-2c2e-397b-ac77-b7dcc9a5872a",
                                "text": "La plupart étaient composées de trois corps en forme de trapèze, empilés les uns sur les autres, de plus en plus petits, comme les terrasses successives d’une ziggourat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40aa2a77-f063-4068-800d-3d37751f88fc",
                                "sense_id": "bdf4564f-2c2e-397b-ac77-b7dcc9a5872a",
                                "text": "Comme ces structures étaient construites en briques d’ argile, la plupart des ziggourats mésopotamiennes furent découverte dans un piètre état de conservation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3167bb83-9ca8-4098-bd75-8043fd9c3e21",
                        "source_entry_id": "e0cb8fd1-cda7-3833-a760-dc3350faace8",
                        "source_sense_id": "bdf4564f-2c2e-397b-ac77-b7dcc9a5872a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zikkurat",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zikkurat",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc88986b-3342-323d-b6f8-209e5048039d",
                                        "entry_id": "1aca0850-38a6-33a5-93a3-2cd7b183c605",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein mehrstufiger Tempelbau der Hochkulturen Mesopotamiens, z. B. der Turm zu Babel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f563cf0f-01fb-4045-a4ee-8514c2852913",
                                                "sense_id": "dc88986b-3342-323d-b6f8-209e5048039d",
                                                "text": "„Die besterhaltene Zikkurat, von den Sumerern dem Mondgott Nanna geweiht, steht in Ur, einer der ältesten Städte der Welt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ee8deea-94d2-46e2-80b1-84191cbb4ffb",
                                                "sense_id": "dc88986b-3342-323d-b6f8-209e5048039d",
                                                "text": "„Doch eines Tages bin ich in Kiel, nachdem ich zum Studium dorthin zurückgekehrt war, zufällig auf diese Zikkurat gestoßen, ein kleines Totenmal aus Granit,…“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "17b007e6-14c8-4ba6-bef4-dde0f023d20b",
                        "source_entry_id": "e0cb8fd1-cda7-3833-a760-dc3350faace8",
                        "source_sense_id": "bdf4564f-2c2e-397b-ac77-b7dcc9a5872a",
                        "target_lang_word": "ziggurat",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ziggurat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5acd7baa-22a8-339f-a676-777cf95e4e73",
                                        "entry_id": "769c6741-a829-3199-8e51-f3039976e0a1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A temple tower of the ancient Mesopotamian valley, having the form of a terraced pyramid of successively receding stories"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87825f64-e331-4371-a968-a99e3b834394",
                                                "sense_id": "5acd7baa-22a8-339f-a676-777cf95e4e73",
                                                "text": "It would be uplifting to think that the ziggurat was the first expression of Near Eastern civilization, for then one could speak about humanity's fascination with the heavens, of the human quest for communion with the infinite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a4be634-8b04-33af-be86-a32462fc8255",
                                        "entry_id": "769c6741-a829-3199-8e51-f3039976e0a1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any building with similar style or shape."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "344f98a1-0912-426b-9ee9-25f8a1fa06fb",
                                                "sense_id": "1a4be634-8b04-33af-be86-a32462fc8255",
                                                "text": "He works in an old ziggurat of an office building."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
